#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0334 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when, in a split Supplemental Qualifier (SUPP--) dataset, the value of RDOMAIN does not equal characters 5 and 6 of the dataset name.
#note "Rule round 2026-10-12 (owner, queued item C3, as c5206c02): RDOMAIN names a domain, and dataset names match case-insensitively (owner 2026-10-01), so the literal comparison reads upper(RDOMAIN). Copy of CDISC-CG0334-valid-SUPPAE.cdt with the RDOMAIN cells lower-cased; the expected outcome is the original one. Red under the old exact comparison."
dataset SUPPAE label="Supplemental Qualifiers for AE"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | ae | 01-701-1015
CDISCPILOT01 | ae | 01-701-1023
---
